  "_comment": "DTK command registry — THE single source of truth for the command catalog. Consumed by core/dispatch.sh (routing), core/menu.sh (menu render), products/mcp-dtk (MCP server.tool generation), and da_cloud-terminal profile-tools.json (generated). Canonical identity = domain.command (e.g. `dtk observe btop`); `shortcode` is an optional legacy accelerator alias (still resolvable: `dtk 30a`). exec.kind: sh = run `sh <run>` relative to repo root; raw = run `<run>` via shell; core = handled by a kept core/lib function (json-reading renderers); orchestrator = cloud-container-orchestrator. interactive=true → cloud-terminal runs it in a PTY tab / dtk in foreground.",
